            "value": "In order to give pedestrians a way to navigate, Team Panasonic has developed a wearable device which is connected to a GPS or wireless connection. The user can pan the horizon with his or her arm and a 3-axis compass with vibration feedback will guide the pedestrian to his or her destination.",
